# object: post-office
# name: The ruined post office
# model: post-office.glb
# note: Front is +Z and faces the dock. The doorway is deliberately uncollided.

# Wall segments traced by hand, recovered from `OpeningSet.buildPostOffice`.
# The front doorway — |x| < 1.1 on the front face — carries no circle on
# purpose: the player has to be able to walk in, and a single footprint circle
# would both seal the entrance and push them off the threshold mid-reveal.
collide circle 1.15 at -2.9 3.4
collide circle 1.15 at 2.9 3.4
collide circle 1.15 at -3.9 1.6
collide circle 1.15 at -3.9 -1
collide circle 1.15 at 3.9 1.6
collide circle 1.15 at 3.9 -1
collide circle 1.15 at -2.4 -3.4
collide circle 1.15 at 0 -3.4
collide circle 1.15 at 2.4 -3.4
clear 9
aperture 0 0 -1
